# Force stable line endings so migration file checksums are identical on every checkout.
# schema_migrations.checksum hashes the raw file bytes; CRLF/LF differences would look like
# migration drift and block startup (see docs/DATABASE.md §migrations).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
